# HFSM JSON config

## Shape

- Exactly **one** root state key per file
- Reserved keys: `enter`, `leave`, `consume`, `states`, `scene`
- Any other key = **binding slot** → entity name string

## `scene`

```json
"scene": { "id": "game", "loading_screen": false, "async_loading": true, "on_event": "ev.open_menu" }
```

- `id` → host path map (`HfsmScenePaths.SCENES`)
- `loading_screen` optional (default `false`)
- `async_loading` optional (default `true`); `false` → sync one-frame load
- `on_event` optional — fired right after scene `initialize(data)`

## Events

- Prefer `ev.*`; omit `enter` → `["sys.enter"]`
- Wildcards: trailing `*` only

## Design

- Heavy screens: `scene`; light logic: BoundEntity slots when needed
- Prefer shallow trees (current app: App → Menu | Battle | PostBattle)
- Do not put HUD buttons / dialogs in HFSM — keep them inside the mounted scene
- Platform hooks (web/Yandex): add nested states later if needed; keep out of `core/`
